c.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_d7e64d1cbeef4d038e3ca613c518369a.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "121", "last_modify_ts": 1794419885915}, {"comment_id": "7655758757334549285", "create_time": 1782495241, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7655699519815961898", "content": "不是贵的问题，是它产量低的问题，良品率也是一个问题。在死守着所谓的古法，没有创新，没有用现代的工业去加速它的制作和更科学的标准去提高良品率。[微笑]现代工业那么发达，这砖的制作过程其实很大程度上都能用机器代替，而且可以效果更好。", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "72", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAwstZmX0RQY32_iGKzLbP4BGR6Ml28TahkVlqrLLo8VCXGU4WpN0D-5IRG2Cz77OQ", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAwstZmX0RQY32_iGKzLbP4BGR6Ml28TahkVlqrLLo8VCXGU4WpN0D-5IRG2Cz77OQ", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "Wells_Yip", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "🌈超限人", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-i-0813c000-ce_oso0uD896E9iAISEiqCwUCB2iffAACLACIz4Ax.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "14", "last_modify_ts": 1794419885915}, {"comment_id": "7655743752296170276", "create_time": 1782491747, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7655699519815961898", "content": "看到这条视频我想到了我上大学的城市，聊城，它的一个县区叫临清，京杭大运河途径的一个城市，它的临清贡砖名气也很响当，当时是皇室御用砖，现在的生存境地也很艰难了", "is_author_digged": false, "is_folded": false, "is_hot": false, "user_buried": false, "user_digged": 0, "digg_count": "116", "user_id": "MS4wLjABAAAAJK6FBPcL2kIvbIb90bx6BHe2hSiCYBgIWq8fYP-_WhQm2zM7GDhDsHW39VFnuMB6", "sec_uid": "MS4wLjABAAAAJK6FBPcL2kIvbIb90bx6BHe2hSiCYBgIWq8fYP-_WhQm2zM7GDhDsHW39VFnuMB6", "short_user_id": "", "user_unique_id": "dy2r225xcvul", "user_signature": "", "nickname": "零六", "avatar": "https://p3-pc.douyinpic.com/aweme/100x100/aweme-avatar/tos-cn-avt-0015_907d071546b0cdb7511ba0f9c3ba33a1.jpeg?from=2064092626", "sub_comment_count": "2", "last_modify_ts": 1794419885915}, {"comment_id": "7655927982816658225", "create_time": 1782534641, "ip_location": "", "aweme_id": "7655699519815961898", "content": "80w是永乐年款的金砖拍卖价、现在的御窑金砖